{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puppet's Last Act is a fast-paced combat game where you control a puppet battling iconic bosses from classic fairy tales. Set in a dramatic theatrical world, each fight is a test of skill and strategy. Face towering adversaries, master your puppet\u2019s abilities, and conquer the stage in a quest to break free from the strings of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/Sweep.gif?t=1741012060\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Tales Fights in Theatrical World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a breathtaking theater-inspired world where every stage comes alive, reimagined villains from classic fairy tales, in epic battles that test your skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/scream.gif?t=1741012060\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your Playstyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash a diverse arsenal of unique weapons and abilities to suit your playstyle, and face off against the sinister Villains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/Weapons.gif?t=1741012060\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537960?t=1741012060","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537960?t=1741012060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/035d2b87e9b3a45823107f0498f95ef75b94055a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741012060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/035d2b87e9b3a45823107f0498f95ef75b94055a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17